ery corner of the skin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUse the big-size pad and cutting pad for both wide and narrow areas, focusing on problem areas or using it as a partial pack.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA product with an integrated tweezer for easily picking up thin pads.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA low-irritation certified product.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eHow to use\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1. Wipe out from the center of the face outwards, following the texture of the skin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2. For intensive care, place the pad on the concerned area for 10 minutes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e3. You can use it by cutting it in half along the incision line.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eIngredients\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Cellulose Gum, Caprylyl\/Capryl Glucoside, Ethylhexylglycerin, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Adenosine, Polyglyceryl-6 Caprylate, Propanediol, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Triethylhexanoin, Disodium EDTA, Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Seed Extract (12.5 ppm), Lentil Fruit Extract (12.5 ppm), Canavalia Gladiata Extract (12.5 pp